Start: {
  shape: circle
  width: 24
  height: 24
  style.fill: "#1B365D"
}

Start -> Midpoint

Midpoint: Test midpoint\nconcept {
  shape: diamond
}

Midpoint -> Forward: Correct + Fast
Midpoint -> Backward: Incorrect / Slow

Forward: Move forward\n(harder concepts)
Backward: Move backward\n(foundational)
Forward -> Check
Backward -> Check

Check: 3 consecutive\ncorrect? {
  shape: diamond
}

Check -> Locked: Yes

Locked: FRONTIER LOCKED\nRecord mastery estimates {
  shape: oval
  style.fill: "#EEF2F7"
}

Check -> Midpoint: No

*.style: {
  fill: "transparent"
  font-color: "#141413"
  border-radius: 6
  stroke: "#6b6a64"
}
